00:55:11.940 --> 00:55:15.090
Sylvia took a job in the mine office, helping with the bookkeeping,

00:55:15.090 --> 00:55:17.900
doing clerical work, and writing some letters for me.

00:55:18.720 --> 00:55:21.180
What a come down from the luxury of your grandfather's home.

00:55:21.730 --> 00:55:24.270
She got up at six, prepared your bottles for the day,

00:55:24.710 --> 00:55:27.590
