00:55:30.960 --> 00:55:37.530
i begged her to write her father she refused so i did and told him how much she needed help

00:55:37.530 --> 00:55:43.190
soon after that the arco mind steadily declined we were short-handed and the strain on sylvia

00:55:43.190 --> 00:55:52.740
was ghastly you alone thrived grew fat and then one night your mother died she was murdered murdered

00:55:52.740 --> 00:55:59.440
by her own father just as surely as if he had shot her with a gun he murdered her and so help me

